NOTICE ON DATA

The training/evaluation pipeline uses the GTZAN dataset (audio) and the
gtzan_tempo_beat annotations. Both are downloaded by scripts/prepare_data.sh
and are NOT redistributed with this repository: they keep their original
licenses and are subject to the terms of their respective owners. GTZAN audio
is widely used for research purposes only; check the original dataset terms
before any other use.
